Algorithm:
step1: Detect alert candle
For bullish case:
Look for last candle in data set if its  green candle which is lying below the 5 EMA line and  its high not touching 5 EMA line
For bearish case:
Look for last candle in data set if its red candle which is lying above the 5 EMA line and  its low not touching 5 EMA line

step2: Check for low/high break
For bullish case:
When the high of the candle next to the alert green candle breaks the high of the alert candle ,take long position keep the low of the alert candle as Stoploss
For bearish case:
When the low of the candle next to the alert red candle breaks the low of the alert candle ,take short position keep the high of the alert candle as Stoploss

Keep Risk : Reward = 1:3


